    "detailed_description": "<strong>Away To The Stars</strong> invites you to step into the shoes of Max, a survivor on a desolate Earth abandoned by humanity. With your forgotten past and newfound extraordinary abilities, embark on a mission to reshape the destiny of humanity on Gaia. <br>As you explore an expansive universe, survival, combat, exploration, and personalization intertwine to offer a gaming experience like no other. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Explore a Massive Universe:</strong> Traverse 1,000,000 procedurally generated planets across 5 captivating galaxies. Each journey promises new discoveries, adventures, and challenges.<br></li><li> <strong>Engage in Exciting Combat:</strong> Battle hostile forces, commandeer pirate ships, and customize your arsenal with unique procedurally generated weapons. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Survival and Resource Management:</strong> Ensure your survival in an unforgiving world by managing your sleep, hunger, health, and energy levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Travel in Style:</strong> Pilot your ship across galaxies and speed through vast planetary landscapes on hover bikes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Unlock Mysteries and Obtain New Ships:</strong> Solve ancient puzzles, enhance your stats, and acquire new vessels for your explorations.<br></li><li> <strong>Shape Your Living Spaces:</strong> Settle on planets and shape your desired living spaces with creative customization options. Trade real estate based on fluctuating market trends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Biomes and Dynamic weather:</strong> Planets have distinct biomes and weather patterns that will affect your stats recovery.<br></li><li> <strong>Complex Dialog System:</strong> Engage with diverse species, each with unique stories to tell, fostering meaningful connections and relationships.<br></li><li> <strong>Personalize Your Spaceship:</strong> Customize your spaceship's interior, not only for aesthetics but to gain an edge in off-planet combat.<br></li><li> <strong>Evocative Narrative:</strong> Dive into a narrative that evolves with every decision you make, a story that transcends even death.<br>Get ready to rediscover humanity's potential in the distant stars. The future of Gaia lies in your hands. Are you ready for the adventure?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Away To The Stars</strong> invites you to step into the shoes of Max, a survivor on a desolate Earth abandoned by humanity. With your forgotten past and newfound extraordinary abilities, embark on a mission to reshape the destiny of humanity on Gaia. <br>As you explore an expansive universe, survival, combat, exploration, and personalization intertwine to offer a gaming experience like no other. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Explore a Massive Universe:</strong> Traverse 1,000,000 procedurally generated planets across 5 captivating galaxies. Each journey promises new discoveries, adventures, and challenges.<br></li><li> <strong>Engage in Exciting Combat:</strong> Battle hostile forces, commandeer pirate ships, and customize your arsenal with unique procedurally generated weapons. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f68741e000b8a2acbb78438a818254ea.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Survival and Resource Management:</strong> Ensure your survival in an unforgiving world by managing your sleep, hunger, health, and energy levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/8a492d1aeaf20b95ee3f789df24b9c76.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Travel in Style:</strong> Pilot your ship across galaxies and speed through vast planetary landscapes on hover bikes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/88ef5863f30b1dfab54bd161effe8cec.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Unlock Mysteries and Obtain New Ships:</strong> Solve ancient puzzles, enhance your stats, and acquire new vessels for your explorations.<br></li><li> <strong>Shape Your Living Spaces:</strong> Settle on planets and shape your desired living spaces with creative customization options. Trade real estate based on fluctuating market trends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.poster.avif?t=1750257706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.webm?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/31ac7e0e687d8e68ac90c8f1007ed00f.mp4?t=1750257706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> <strong>Biomes and Dynamic weather:</strong> Planets have distinct biomes and weather patterns that will affect your stats recovery.<br></li><li> <strong>Complex Dialog System:</strong> Engage with diverse species, each with unique stories to tell, fostering meaningful connections and relationships.<br></li><li> <strong>Personalize Your Spaceship:</strong> Customize your spaceship's interior, not only for aesthetics but to gain an edge in off-planet combat.<br></li><li> <strong>Evocative Narrative:</strong> Dive into a narrative that evolves with every decision you make, a story that transcends even death.<br>Get ready to rediscover humanity's potential in the distant stars. The future of Gaia lies in your hands. Are you ready for the adventure?</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a top-down survival RPG. Battle on foot or from your ship, traversing a pixelated endless universe. Hack, loot, trade, land on or steal freighters and ships. Be a property developer, and interact with alien life including trusty companions, to discover your past and the future of humanity.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cLove what you're doing with this game! Been having a blast exploring and seeing the content there is to offer.\u201d<br>Veetus<br><br>\u201cThey just made Starfield here!\u201d<br>Videogameiacs<br><br>\u201cBtw, I love the vibe you got going here. The music really ties it together\u201d<br>Retronator<br>",
